      "subject": "kĩringĩtia kĩa nje",
      "rationale": "חיצונה nĩ 'ya nje' — ⟨kĩa nje⟩ nĩcio ciongereirwo kũrera ũhoro wa kĩngeranio kĩa Gĩkũyũ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "ciĩtari",
      "rationale": "חיל nĩ hinya wa andũ arĩa mothe, arutani — 'ciĩtari' gũcokia gĩkundi kĩu kĩmwe tu."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "ĩrahĩrirwo",
      "rationale": "הבצרות nĩ gĩcunjĩ kĩa kĩugo kĩa Kĩhibirania; Gĩkũyũ kĩhootanĩtia kĩugo kĩrĩa kĩngĩtarĩ kĩmwe."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na thutha wa macio, akũũra ⟨kĩringĩtia kĩa nje⟩ kĩa mucĩĩ wa Dawidi, itherũrũ rĩa Gihoni rũnyinyini-inĩ, kinya mũrango-inĩ wa rũyũ, na gũkorerera Ofeli, akanakĩringĩhĩria kĩnene mũno, na gũcoka akĩĩhandĩthia atongoria a ciĩtari mĩcĩĩ-inĩ ĩrĩa yothe ĩrahĩrirwo ya Yahuda.",
